WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.010
Oliver's class had a pet rat.

2
00:00:16.011 --> 00:00:20.346
The kids took turns taking the rat home.

3
00:00:20.347 --> 00:00:24.481
It was Oliver's turn.

4
00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:29.855
Oliver brought the cage home.

5
00:00:29.856 --> 00:00:34.507
He took the rat out.

6
00:00:34.508 --> 00:00:37.912
"Eek!" said Emmy.

7
00:00:37.913 --> 00:00:43.664
"That rat looks scary."

8
00:00:43.665 --> 00:00:47.098
"Ratty is nice," said Oliver.

9
00:00:47.099 --> 00:00:51.874
Ratty sat on Oliver's shoulder.

10
00:00:51.875 --> 00:00:57.363
"Rats are dirty," said Mom.

11
00:00:57.364 --> 00:01:01.759
"Ratty is clean," said Oliver.

12
00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:10.376
Ratty washed his face with his paw.

13
00:01:10.377 --> 00:01:13.928
"Rats are ugly," said Harry.

14
00:01:13.929 --> 00:01:17.237
"Ratty is cute," said Oliver.

15
00:01:17.238 --> 00:01:22.489
Ratty wiggled his nose.

16
00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:26.904
"Rats are smart," said Dad.

17
00:01:26.905 --> 00:01:30.729
"Let's build a place for Ratty to play.

18
00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:34.780
Everyone can help."

19
00:01:34.781 --> 00:01:39.098
"Not me," said Mom.

20
00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:43.934
"No way," said Harry.

21
00:01:43.935 --> 00:01:50.011
"No thanks!" said Emmy.

22
00:01:50.012 --> 00:01:55.225
Oliver got his blocks.

23
00:01:55.226 --> 00:02:01.092
Dad and Oliver built a castle.

24
00:02:01.093 --> 00:02:04.688
Oliver put Ratty near the castle.

25
00:02:04.689 --> 00:02:08.344
Ratty ran in the door.

26
00:02:08.345 --> 00:02:13.503
"He's climbing up the steps!" said Harry.

27
00:02:13.504 --> 00:02:20.806
"He's climbing out a window!" said Emmy.

28
00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:23.779
"Ratty is smart," said Harry.

29
00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:26.414
"Yes," said Emmy.

30
00:02:26.415 --> 00:02:29.766
"He's really smart!"

31
00:02:29.767 --> 00:02:34.634
Ratty stood on his back legs.

32
00:02:34.635 --> 00:02:40.634
"Ratty is hungry now," said Oliver.

33
00:02:40.635 --> 00:02:43.517
Ratty wiggled his nose.

34
00:02:43.518 --> 00:02:47.972
"Aw. He looks so cute," said Emmy.

35
00:02:47.973 --> 00:02:52.303
"See Ratty, Mom?"

36
00:02:52.304 --> 00:02:58.213
"I think Mom ran away from Ratty," said Dad.

37
00:02:58.214 --> 00:03:03.216
"Here I come," called Mom.

38
00:03:03.217 --> 00:03:18.604
"I got that cute rat some peanuts!"
